// The y+ = 1 first layer (about 10 um) on 2.4 mm skin faces is a flat cell:
// determinant ~ 27 (t/a)^2 = 5e-4, under the default 1e-3, which made snappyHexMesh
// strip the layers (wing 1.8 of 20 at the 1.82 m span). The solver is fine with
// such prisms; only snappy's moves use this check.
minDeterminant  1e-5;

